('advanced-native-820', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-820-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["New information made a future route seem more hopeful and clearer."],"options":["The mentor installed lights along a physical walking route.","The mentor chose the entire career without involving her.","The training options had become less accessible after the conversation.","New information made a future route seem more hopeful and clearer."]},"advanced-native-820-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The advice gave me a clearer idea of where to begin.","I felt more hopeful because the options were explained in practical terms.","I learnt about training routes that I had not considered.","It brightened my path by making the next steps feel more possible."],"options":["The advice gave me a clearer idea of where to begin.","I felt more hopeful because the options were explained in practical terms.","I learnt about training routes that I had not considered.","It brightened my path by making the next steps feel more possible."]},"advanced-native-820-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The guidance helped brighten her path."],"options":["The guidance removed her ability to compare the courses herself.","The guidance only concerned installing lamps on a route to school.","The guidance helped brighten her path."]},"advanced-native-820-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every later obstacle has necessarily been removed."],"options":["Context is needed to identify what support was given.","Support can make future possibilities seem more hopeful.","Every later obstacle has necessarily been removed."]},"advanced-native-820-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Say the advice helped brighten your path, then explain how it gave you options you could compare yourself."],"options":["Keep the claim that the mentor chose everything and leave out your own comparison of the courses.","List only the course names without explaining how the advice changed your view of the future.","Say t