('advanced-native-825', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-825-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker presented readiness while privately wanting more time with family."],"options":["The speaker presented readiness while privately wanting more time with family.","The speaker had no private uncertainty and wanted to leave immediately.","The speaker was describing the physical depth of a room near the family home.","The family had already decided the move without asking the speaker."]},"advanced-native-825-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I needed to be honest about the part of me that wanted to stay a little longer.","I realised I wanted more time near my family.","Deep down, I was not as ready as I had sounded.","My outward confidence did not reflect all my feelings."],"options":["I needed to be honest about the part of me that wanted to stay a little longer.","I realised I wanted more time near my family.","Deep down, I was not as ready as I had sounded.","My outward confidence did not reflect all my feelings."]},"advanced-native-825-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Deep down, I knew I wanted to explore the other subject."],"options":["My confident words prove that I had no different private feeling.","Everyone else had already chosen the subject for me without discussion.","Deep down, I knew I wanted to explore the other subject."]},"advanced-native-825-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A person’s sincere belief must establish the external facts."],"options":["A person’s sincere belief must establish the external facts.","Context is needed to know whose feeling is being described.","The sentence may describe a private belief rather than an outward statement."]},"advanced-native-825-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We cannot know what he feels deep down from a smile alone; ask how he sees the arrangement."],"options":["We cannot know what he feels deep down from a smile alone; ask how he sees the arrangement.","Treat the smile as enough evid