('advanced-native-828', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-828-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Trust in the shared plan lies beneath the disagreement about time."],"options":["The only remaining concern is fitting the meeting around two otherwise trusted plans.","Both sides have already resolved every concern about the plan.","Changing the meeting time alone would address the underlying concern completely.","Trust in the shared plan lies beneath the disagreement about time."]},"advanced-native-828-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Both sides still doubted whether the agreed arrangements would be respected.","The timing change did not address the underlying confidence problem.","The concern went deeper than the time on the calendar.","At its root, the dispute was about trust in the shared plan."],"options":["Both sides still doubted whether the agreed arrangements would be respected.","The timing change did not address the underlying confidence problem.","The concern went deeper than the time on the calendar.","At its root, the dispute was about trust in the shared plan."]},"advanced-native-828-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["At its root, the dispute is about fairness in the division of work."],"options":["The discussion has already ended with full agreement on every responsibility.","At its root, the dispute is about fairness in the division of work.","The desk position is the only concern, and everyone is satisfied with the roles."]},"advanced-native-828-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A topic was mentioned first, but no link to the cause has been examined."],"options":["Clarifying the underlying concern explains why surface changes did not settle the dispute.","Several related incidents point to the same underlying trust issue.","A topic was mentioned first, but no link to the cause has been examined."]},"advanced-native-828-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Before saying what lies at its root, ask whether the desk issue reflects a deeper conce